  "identifier": "datastew",
  "name": "datastew",
  "description": "Python library for intelligent data harmonization using large language model (LLM) embeddings. Maps variables, concepts, and codes across heterogeneous datasets to standard terminologies — helping harmonise clinical and research data for interoperability and pooled analysis. Installable from PyPI. From Fraunhofer SCAI.",
